{"version":1,"content":"<p>張致恒（Steven）和太太區燕雯（雯雯）婚後育有4名兒子，一家六口長年面對財困。</p><p>近年，Steven雖然頻頻傳出向身邊朋友借貸，亦同時極力尋求重返幕前的機會，以求改善生活。</p><p>近日他與舊愛黃榕同框接受網台節目訪問，豈料此舉觸發雯雯神經，於社交平台上連環發文炮轟。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:57.589370+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.892705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.892705+00:00","content_hash":"e6ec45ed2c2148031773532fe31a3b3fe99461db8a377be4f6bb20af373cbec3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}